    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/test-plan-execution.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The nodes, and who points at whom",
      "prov:value": "| node | schema | where it lives |\n|---|---|---|\n| the plan | `test-plan/v1` — `schemas/sdlc/test-plan.ts` | authored content (`test-plan` kind) |\n| the system under test | the `systemUnderTest` facet on an actor — `schemas/kg/skill-package.ts` | `scenarios/actors/*.json` |\n| the run | `folio-test-run/v1` with `plan` + `sut` — `schemas/sdlc/test-run.ts` | the declared `qa` directory |\n| the report | `test-report/v1` — `schemas/sdlc/test-report.ts` | the `qa-reports` branch, `tests/<plan>/<sut>/<run>/` |\n| the certification | a judgement, `qa-attestations/v1` | the declared `attestations` graph, on main (D2 (a), D5 default) |",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "D2",
        "D5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/test-plan-execution.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The nodes, and who points at whom",
      "prov:value": "**The platform model is FHIR-free.** FHIR R5 TestPlan *informed* `test-plan/v1`\nand is a DOWNSTREAM export target (bean `18p1`, in the FHIR IG layer).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 18p1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/test-plan-execution.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "The system under test is a facet, not a role",
      "prov:value": "`kind` is the closed list `SUT_KINDS` (`skill`, `agent`, `tool`, `machine`,\n`ig`, `process`; owner ruling) — the same vocabulary as a plan's\n`scope.kind`, so the two are compared, not translated."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/test-plan-execution.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Tester",
      "prov:value": "**Resolve the plan.** P parses as `test-plan/v1`, names at least one `req:`\n   requirement (owner ruling), its `exitCriteria.decision` resolves to a\n   decision in a `.dmn` that exists, and its `scope.kind` matches the SUT\n   actor's facet kind."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/test-plan-execution.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Tester",
      "prov:value": "**Bind the test data** (bean `vm6m`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean vm6m"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/test-plan-execution.md#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Tester",
      "prov:value": "**Write the run and the report.** The run records `plan {id, version}` and\n   `sut {actor, version, reach}`; the report rolls up per plan, never across\n   plans (`py74`), and `testReportPath` says where it goes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/test-plan-execution.md#provenance-8",
